  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.11 - Enhanced Hangfire Job ID Capture\n• IMPROVED: Enhanced RecurringJobId capture through multiple filter interfaces\n• NEW: Implements IClientFilter and IElectStateFilter for better job tracking\n• IMPROVED: More reliable job ID detection during job creation and state transitions\n• IMPROVED: Fallback mechanisms for capturing job IDs in various Hangfire configurations\n• STABLE: Fully backward compatible with existing implementations\n\nv1.0.10 - Auto-Registration & Self-Healing Monitors\n• NEW: Automatic monitor registration on 404 responses\n• NEW: Monitor configuration caching for resilience\n• IMPROVED: Self-healing monitors recover from deletion",
  "repository": "",
